      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Competitive affair to close out the card. PRUCIA (7) wasn't disgraced in town at the latest effort and should find this assignment much more to her liking. Has placed two from two around this circuit, gets 2kg off and draws the inside alley. Sure to be right there at the business end. THAT'S AN EXTRA (3) is a four-time winner around this circuit who has won when fresh before. Worth including. The well-related RUNAROUND SUE (4) (half to G3 winner Thiamandi) goes well for hoop Lowe who has only missed a place once in seven rides. Top-three commodity with the claim. KING OF THE JUNGLE (2) resumes here but has revved up for this with two solid trials and a strong first-up showing would not surprise.",
